{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"The library assigns disk and transport work to its caller, with explicit persistence and message-ordering duties. I’m tracing how acknowledgments become quorum support and how term or membership changes affect that support before selecting a test.\n"}}
